    "acceptanceCriteria": [
      {
        "id": "AC-1",
        "text": "`RouteBuilder` is a public interface in `com.snoworca.naruserve` declaring `get`, `post`, `put`, `patch`, `delete`, `head` and `options`, each taking a `RouteHandler` and returning `RouteBuilder`, so `app.route(\"/u/:id\").get(h1).put(h2).delete(h3)` compiles. [D-043] Decision: each `RouteBuilder` registration method returns the same builder instance it was called on. [SDS 2026-10-19.naruserve.naruserve-v1-wave-3-1 SDS-AC-7]",
        "checked": true,
        "line": 1070
      },
      {
        "id": "AC-2",
        "text": "Through the harness, after `app.route(\"/u/:id\").get(h1).put(h2).delete(h3)`, `GET`, `PUT` and `DELETE /u/1` each reach only their own handler. [D-043; T03]",
        "checked": true,
        "line": 1071
      },
      {
        "id": "AC-3",
        "text": "Registering `app.get(\"/x\", h1)` and `app.route(\"/x\").get(h2)` makes the harness freeze throw `RoutingConfigException` naming the duplicate. [D-044; T03; wave decision: Working app in wave 3]",
        "checked": true,
        "line": 1072
      },
      {
        "id": "AC-4",
        "text": "`app.get(\"/x\", h)` and `app.route(\"/x\").get(h)` record the same method set, pattern and route kind in the router registration. [D-044]",
        "checked": true,
        "line": 1073
      }
    ],
